{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98707","id":2627539871,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6cnROf","number":98707,"title":"Editor plugin hooks return immediatly ignoring `await`","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-10-31T18:18:05Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T08:51:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n4.4.dev\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nWindows 11 - Vulkan (Forward+)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nCoroutines don't work in `EditorPlugin` hooks like:\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends EditorPlugin\r\n\r\n# The project runs immediately and \"finished build check\" prints after it\r\nfunc _build() -> bool:\r\n\tprint(\"awaiting _build\")\r\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(3).timeout\r\n\tprint(\"finished _build\")\r\n\treturn false\r\n```\r\nOther hooks used together with `EditorPlugin` like `EditorExportPlugin._customize_resource` also return immediately ignoring `await`. This makes it impossible to customize resources that depend on threaded features like `NavigationMesh` baking or the render thread.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nRun MRP. Build should not return because `_build()` in \"res://addons/plugin/plugin.gd\" returns false.\r\nBut it runs anyway and \"Finished Build\" is printed 3 seconds later.\r\n\r\nExport MRP. It should print \"finished _customize_resource\" after exporting.\r\nBut it exports immediately and the message is printed 3 seconds later.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[plugin-await-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17591683/plugin-await-issue.zip)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98707/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}